WEBVTT

00:04.040 --> 00:06.670
I won the Crimson Lord's War,

00:06.670 --> 00:10.290
and as a reward I was given
a two-week long vacation.

00:14.710 --> 00:17.630
That's what I was given, but...

00:16.000 --> 00:19.130
<b>Gerra-Arka Republic</b>

00:16.000 --> 00:19.130
<b>Dark Core Zone</b>

00:23.460 --> 00:26.920
I'm on a vacation,
but I didn't ask for any beach!

00:26.920 --> 00:28.170
Miss Komari.

00:29.710 --> 00:32.670
Your swimsuit looks good on you.

00:32.960 --> 00:34.830
Y-you think so?

00:35.500 --> 00:37.920
Sakuna, who became a spy for Inverse Moon

00:37.920 --> 00:41.500
and carried out serial murders of
high-ranking government officials,

00:41.500 --> 00:44.380
received a punishment from the Empress.

00:45.750 --> 00:51.540
She's leading the 6th Unit and constantly
engaged in war with other countries...

00:52.630 --> 00:58.130
and Sakuna says they've won
three out of five battles this week.

00:59.460 --> 01:03.250
Miss Komari! The water feels great!

01:03.670 --> 01:07.380
That means she's died twice, basically...

01:07.630 --> 01:13.330
Lady Komari, how are you so easily
won over by Lady Memoir?

01:13.330 --> 01:18.170
I-I didn't give in to her or anything,
I'm just hanging out with Sakuna.

01:18.170 --> 01:19.750
Well, it's fine.

01:19.750 --> 01:23.790
I'm happy that you have
gained interest in going out.

01:24.750 --> 01:26.460
And with that being said...

01:26.460 --> 01:28.580
please play with me too.

01:28.580 --> 01:30.250
What do you mean by that?!

01:33.500 --> 01:36.250
Terakomari Gandesblood...

01:36.670 --> 01:38.880
So, we finally meet.

01:41.960 --> 02:03.920
<b>The Vexations of a Shut-in Vampire Princess</b>

03:10.130 --> 03:15.000
<b>A Warblade Tea Party</b>

03:13.630 --> 03:15.000
In order to become a writer,

03:15.130 --> 03:17.580
I need all sorts of experiences.

03:17.580 --> 03:21.420
So, this is an investment towards my future.

03:23.330 --> 03:25.960
I am in no way excited by this.

03:31.750 --> 03:35.500
I should in no way be excited by this...

03:43.500 --> 03:46.540
What? I might be kinda having a blast...

03:50.000 --> 03:52.920
Lady Komari, play time is over.

03:52.920 --> 03:56.380
What?! But why?
I wanna play some more!

03:56.880 --> 04:00.710
There's been communication from
Captain Mellaconcey on reconnaissance.

04:00.710 --> 04:02.330
It seems Nelia Cunningham

04:02.330 --> 04:05.000
has completed preparations for her
meeting with you, Lady Komari.

04:05.000 --> 04:06.880
Eh? Nelia?

04:06.880 --> 04:08.540
What was that about again?

04:08.540 --> 04:11.080
Lady Komari, have you
forgotten the reason

04:11.080 --> 04:14.210
we've come all the way to
a Gerra-Aruka resort?

04:14.210 --> 04:15.290
Oh!

04:16.380 --> 04:19.500
It started with one of the proud
Eight Illustrious Generals

04:19.500 --> 04:21.250
of the Republic of Gerra-Aruka,

04:21.250 --> 04:25.710
a Nelia Cunningham who also holds the
grandiose name of "Moonpeach Princess,"

04:23.540 --> 04:29.250
<b>Moonpeach Princess</b>

04:25.710 --> 04:28.750
sending an invitation addressed to me.

04:29.710 --> 04:33.920
In the invitation, it stated that me
holding a battle in the Gerra-Aruka region

04:33.920 --> 04:36.080
would be taken as an act of aggression,

04:36.080 --> 04:39.500
so it began with a false accusation
that I have absolutely no memory of.

04:40.210 --> 04:43.040
In order to measure the easing of tensions
between the two countries,

04:43.040 --> 04:45.750
we were invited to a tea party at the resort.

04:45.750 --> 04:50.290
I was trying to shut it down with things
like "This is definitely a trap!" but...

04:53.080 --> 04:55.330
Well then, Komari, be lured in by the invite,

04:55.330 --> 04:58.580
pull a fast one on them, and try
and guess the enemy's capabilities.

04:58.580 --> 05:02.830
And with the Empress' words,
we went full speed ahead towards the trap!

05:02.830 --> 05:04.670
And that's why we're here...

05:05.630 --> 05:09.630
But my troops are here as bodyguards...

05:09.630 --> 05:12.920
Huh? Speaking of, I thought they
came to the beach with us...

05:12.920 --> 05:14.880
Oh, if you're worried about the others...

05:15.460 --> 05:18.630
They bet on a selfie with you
in your swimsuit,

05:18.630 --> 05:22.040
and have started competing using the
beach tower instead of beach flags.

05:22.830 --> 05:26.750
By the way, the first one to touch
the "Daydream Paradise"

05:23.130 --> 05:31.710
<b>Daydream Paradise</b>

05:26.750 --> 05:29.500
that we booked was the winner, I've heard.

05:29.500 --> 05:32.670
What is with these people doing things
without permission?!

05:36.960 --> 05:38.830
Wh-what do I do, Vill?

05:38.830 --> 05:42.330
I'm not mentally prepared to have
a tea party on enemy territory...

05:42.330 --> 05:44.040
Please relax.

05:44.040 --> 05:46.710
I still have my "Pandora Poison."

05:48.170 --> 05:51.170
Lady Memoir. Please suck my blood.

05:51.380 --> 05:53.790
What?! Miss Villhaze?!

05:53.790 --> 05:56.040
What are you being so shy about?

05:56.040 --> 05:58.040
This is my job to the bitter end.

05:58.040 --> 05:59.580
It's all for Lady Komari.

05:59.580 --> 06:01.250
Y-yes, I know, but...

06:01.250 --> 06:02.380
Come on.

06:03.880 --> 06:06.830
W-well then, pardon me...

06:26.210 --> 06:27.830
You drank too much.

06:27.830 --> 06:29.420
I-I'm sorry...

06:29.420 --> 06:30.630
It's nothing.

06:30.630 --> 06:33.130
But... you did very well.

06:33.130 --> 06:34.710
R-right...

06:35.540 --> 06:37.880
I also thought it was delicious.

06:38.380 --> 06:40.380
What the heck?

06:40.380 --> 06:42.920
What did I just watch?

06:46.460 --> 06:49.960
I have seen Lady Memoir's future.

06:51.710 --> 06:55.210
Don't worry. Lady Komari will not die.

06:56.880 --> 06:58.170
Say, Vill.

06:58.170 --> 07:00.710
Gerra-Aruka is the domain of
the Warblades, right?

07:00.710 --> 07:02.540
Well, what are they like?

07:02.540 --> 07:05.380
In short, they are sword users.

07:05.380 --> 07:08.290
Rumor has it they have body parts
made of metal, too.

07:13.040 --> 07:18.080
Welcome to the Warblade tea party,
Miss Terakomari Gandesblood.

07:19.040 --> 07:21.500
It's a pleasure to meet you, I'm Nelia!

07:21.500 --> 07:24.170
I would like to extend my
utmost appreciation to you

07:24.170 --> 07:26.210
for coming such a long way
to get here, Miss Terakomari!

07:26.790 --> 07:30.830
Now, Gertrude, prepare the special tea
we put aside for them!

07:30.830 --> 07:32.670
Yes, Lady Nelia.

07:43.710 --> 07:45.580
I'm so sorry for the noise.

07:45.580 --> 07:47.710
She's always been an airhead.

07:48.290 --> 07:50.210
Let me offer you a greeting once more.

07:50.210 --> 07:53.380
Welcome, to the Warblade tea party.

08:00.380 --> 08:03.830
By the way, this is a bit weird to ask, but...

08:03.830 --> 08:06.580
Why did I get an invitation?

08:06.580 --> 08:08.960
This is the first time we're meeting, right?

08:08.960 --> 08:10.960
We've met before, haven't we?

08:10.960 --> 08:11.830
Huh?

08:11.830 --> 08:13.540
I knew it.

08:14.040 --> 08:17.290
I thought you wouldn't
remember it anyway, Komari...

08:18.080 --> 08:19.790
Oh, can I call you Komari?

08:19.790 --> 08:22.460
I don't mind you calling me Nelia.

08:22.460 --> 08:24.330
Yeah, I don't mind.

08:24.330 --> 08:28.290
Thanks. Now I feel like
our relationship can go further.

08:29.960 --> 08:32.420
An up-and-coming Crimson Lord commander,

08:32.420 --> 08:34.960
who's making her name well-known
across the Six Nations,

08:34.960 --> 08:37.080
Terakomari Gandesblood.

08:37.710 --> 08:40.210
The reason I called you here

08:40.210 --> 08:44.540
is that I wanted to witness the true nature
and strength of someone whose

08:44.540 --> 08:46.500
glorious military name is so well-known.

08:46.500 --> 08:51.790
Oh, I see. Well, I guess there's
no vampire more obvious than me!

08:51.790 --> 08:54.580
Everyone calls me "Mistress of the Massacre"

08:54.580 --> 08:57.750
and the "Strongest Vampire"
and all sorts of names like that,

08:57.750 --> 09:00.750
but to be honest with you,
it's all the truth.

09:01.080 --> 09:03.710
That is absolutely exquisite, Komari!

09:03.710 --> 09:04.460
Huh?

09:04.460 --> 09:07.290
You are thoroughly dignified
in every word you say!

09:07.290 --> 09:09.580
The dignity of a "Mistress of Massacre"!

09:09.580 --> 09:13.290
Y-you think so? I tried to hide it
but I guess it's slipped out...

09:13.290 --> 09:14.460
Totally transparent!

09:14.460 --> 09:15.830
I mean, that face?

09:15.830 --> 09:18.380
No matter how you crack it,
that is the face of a killer!

09:18.380 --> 09:21.040
Is that the face I'm making?

09:21.040 --> 09:24.830
Say, Komari, how many people
have you killed so far?

09:24.830 --> 09:27.080
Um, maybe around 50,000.

09:27.080 --> 09:28.960
What a coincidence! Same here!

09:28.960 --> 09:30.380
Someone call the cops!

09:30.380 --> 09:33.250
She's a serious criminal
who's killed 50,000 people!

09:33.250 --> 09:35.920
You pass, if you've killed that many.

09:35.920 --> 09:41.670
If your true nature met my expectations,
I was thinking of inviting you.

09:41.670 --> 09:42.790
To what?

09:44.630 --> 09:46.790
The plan for world domination.

09:47.630 --> 09:49.040
What?

10:00.460 --> 10:03.170
World... domination?

10:03.170 --> 10:06.500
Yes! If you and I team up,
we'll be unbeatable, you know?

10:07.330 --> 10:09.670
"I'm going to turn the world
into omelette rice!"

10:09.670 --> 10:12.460
That is your unvarnished
and true intention, correct?

10:12.460 --> 10:13.920
W-wait!

10:13.920 --> 10:16.920
What is your plan for world domination?

10:18.000 --> 10:22.210
First, wipe out the Heavenly Paradise
since they've been getting cocky recently.

10:22.630 --> 10:26.130
Then, decimate the conceited
Haku-Goku Commonwealth,

10:26.130 --> 10:30.130
followed by eradicating The Enchanted Lands
who are posing as neutral,

10:30.130 --> 10:32.880
and while we're at it,
annihilate the Lapelico Kingdom.

10:32.880 --> 10:34.250
Perfect, right?

10:35.500 --> 10:37.920
Yeah, perfectly full of holes...

10:38.460 --> 10:41.040
I think that world domination is a bad idea!

10:41.040 --> 10:41.960
Sakuna?

10:41.960 --> 10:44.040
Oh my, Sakuna Memoir,

10:44.040 --> 10:47.210
do you mean to interrupt
Komari and I and our ambition?

10:47.500 --> 10:50.290
Miss Komari is the type
to try to settle things like that

10:50.290 --> 10:52.290
through conversation if at all possible!

10:52.790 --> 10:55.540
She can't join you in your ambition!

10:55.540 --> 10:57.250
That's right, Lady Cunningham.

10:57.250 --> 11:00.040
Lady Komari will achieve
world domination on her own.

11:00.040 --> 11:03.420
She has no need to purposefully
join forces with someone who is

11:03.420 --> 11:06.290
a not very popular Commander like you.

11:07.250 --> 11:08.540
O-oh crap...

11:08.540 --> 11:12.290
What happens when you piss off
a murder machine with 50,000 kills?

11:13.420 --> 11:14.290
Hmph!

11:14.290 --> 11:16.710
Are you saying you don't need my help?!

11:17.080 --> 11:17.960
Huh?

11:17.960 --> 11:20.960
Unbelievable! Truly unthinkable!

11:22.040 --> 11:25.790
Listen, I'll take this opportunity now
to tell the truth.

11:26.210 --> 11:30.000
Even if I did have the power
to take over the world,

11:30.000 --> 11:32.130
I refuse to use it recklessly.

11:32.290 --> 11:35.290
And that's because I'm a pacifist.

11:36.880 --> 11:41.920
Generally, power isn't something to use
to make people obey,

11:41.920 --> 11:45.710
it should be used for seeking world peace.

11:49.750 --> 11:50.580
Komari.

11:50.580 --> 11:51.790
For Aruka, I want-

11:51.790 --> 11:54.380
Your Excellency!
I apologize for the suddenness!

11:54.380 --> 11:56.500
There's something I must relay immediately!

11:56.500 --> 11:58.290
What is it, Bellius?

11:58.290 --> 12:00.790
The 7th Unit, who were
betting and competing for

12:00.790 --> 12:02.790
the two-person swimsuit selfie with you,

12:02.790 --> 12:05.210
have encountered the Gerra-Aruka troops

12:05.210 --> 12:07.540
who were stationed outside
the destination hotel...

12:07.540 --> 12:10.880
The rush of the 7th Unit was misunderstood
as an advance on their army,

12:10.880 --> 12:13.330
and a battle broke out...

12:13.330 --> 12:18.630
But the enemy was weak for some reason,
and they were stamped out in no time at all.

12:20.080 --> 12:22.330
Did he say "weak"?

12:22.750 --> 12:27.420
My 1st Unit troops are the strongest
of the elite, even in Gerra-Aruka...

12:27.420 --> 12:31.250
Uh... we wiped out Nelia's troops.

12:34.630 --> 12:36.460
Huh?! What was that?!

12:39.500 --> 12:41.170
Bellius, what's that?

12:41.170 --> 12:42.880
Probably Mellaconcey,

12:42.880 --> 12:46.920
that guy likes to blow up tall buildings.

12:46.920 --> 12:49.710
Komari... now you've done it!

12:49.710 --> 12:51.710
Um... Sorry.

12:51.710 --> 12:54.710
You really think just "sorry"
is gonna cut it?!

12:57.130 --> 13:00.790
Well, I've secured an escape route,
so we're getting out of here.

13:00.790 --> 13:01.580
Wait!

13:01.580 --> 13:02.630
Whoa!

13:02.630 --> 13:04.250
Where are you, Komari?!

13:04.250 --> 13:06.460
You were ready for that, weren't you?

13:06.460 --> 13:08.250
I saw the future.

13:08.250 --> 13:09.130
Huh?

13:09.130 --> 13:13.420
Then isn't there a better way to solve this?!

13:17.330 --> 13:21.500
On behalf of Her Excellency Terakomari,
this is her maid Vill on the line.

13:21.500 --> 13:22.920
All personnel evacuate.

13:22.920 --> 13:26.000
Get away from there immediately
and return to Mulnite.

13:26.830 --> 13:29.830
Gerra-Aruka is now a
completely hostile nation.

13:31.210 --> 13:34.170
I hope everyone got to escape.

13:34.170 --> 13:35.920
This is a Dark Core Zone.

13:35.920 --> 13:39.080
It's within the bounds of effectiveness
of Mulnite's Dark Core,

13:39.080 --> 13:41.420
so if you die, you'll be revived.

13:41.830 --> 13:45.170
But I really don't want to die after all...

13:45.380 --> 13:46.500
Your Excellency...

13:50.710 --> 13:52.380
Hey there, Komari!

13:52.380 --> 13:54.330
Having a good time at the resort?

13:54.330 --> 13:57.790
It's a pity, We really wanted to
join you if at all possible!

13:57.790 --> 14:02.380
Komari, when you return, shall I rub some
tanning oil on you at the palace pool?

14:02.380 --> 14:03.880
Just rub it all over...

14:03.880 --> 14:05.380
Not happening!

14:05.380 --> 14:07.330
If you don't need anything I'm hanging up!

14:08.670 --> 14:10.130
I'm kidding!

14:10.130 --> 14:14.080
Actually, there's an envoy here
from Heavenly Paradise

14:14.080 --> 14:17.080
saying they want to talk to you about
the end of the Six Nations.

14:17.080 --> 14:23.710
That envoy, someone named Karla Amatsu,
insisted on talking with you, Komari.

14:29.580 --> 14:31.000
I smell it...

14:31.000 --> 14:34.000
I'm catching a whiff of a scoop here!

14:34.000 --> 14:37.210
Miss Melca, let's stop this.

14:37.210 --> 14:40.880
If we're found, it's prison for us.

14:40.880 --> 14:43.250
Thio, is the camera holding up okay?

14:43.250 --> 14:46.000
Huh? Yeah, it's doing pretty well.

14:46.380 --> 14:48.460
I got a picture of a butterfly!

14:48.460 --> 14:50.580
Can a butterfly put food on the table?!

14:50.920 --> 14:53.630
Are you listening?! What you're
taking photos of is the scoop!

14:53.630 --> 14:56.540
If we fail to get a picture of Karla Amatsu,

14:56.540 --> 14:59.830
I'm gonna make both your ears and tail
poofy for one whole week!

14:59.830 --> 15:01.130
Amatsu?

15:01.330 --> 15:02.170
Amatsu...

15:02.170 --> 15:03.830
It's Karla!

15:03.830 --> 15:06.790
She's one of the Five Imperial Sabers
of Heavenly Paradise,

15:06.790 --> 15:11.540
and we got info that she's
in Mulnite incognito!

15:06.790 --> 15:10.830
<b>Heavenly Paradise Five Imperial Sabers</b>

15:06.790 --> 15:10.830
<b>Karla Amatsu</b>

15:14.210 --> 15:16.670
I'll tell you this bluntly:

15:17.210 --> 15:21.000
My purpose in visiting this country
is to form an alliance.

15:21.000 --> 15:22.000
An alliance?

15:25.040 --> 15:27.500
Her Majesty the Empress is also aware,

15:27.500 --> 15:31.210
but Heavenly Paradise and Gerra-Aruka
are on very bad terms.

15:31.210 --> 15:33.540
The enemy of my enemy is my friend.

15:34.130 --> 15:39.000
Perhaps our interests coincide with
those of the Mulnite Empire.

15:39.000 --> 15:40.380
Indeed.

15:40.380 --> 15:44.580
Ever since they've changed from the
Kingdom of Aruka to Gerra-Aruka Republic,

15:44.580 --> 15:48.000
their struggle for territories behind
closed doors has become normalized.

15:48.000 --> 15:51.000
I can't believe Heavenly Paradise
is proposing an alliance...

15:51.000 --> 15:53.080
This is an extra-large scoop!

15:53.080 --> 15:56.330
Er... was Gerra-Aruka a monarchy?

15:56.330 --> 15:58.330
It was until five years ago.

15:58.330 --> 16:01.830
The current president, Madhart,
started a revolution,

16:01.830 --> 16:04.040
and it transitioned into a republic.

16:04.040 --> 16:07.040
Are you suggesting that Mulnite
and Heavenly Paradise

16:07.040 --> 16:09.960
join together and confront
our common enemy?

16:09.960 --> 16:10.920
No.

16:11.460 --> 16:15.960
To be honest with you,
there's no need to confront them.

16:15.960 --> 16:18.960
My country is of the belief that
one should not go into a futile battle.

16:18.960 --> 16:19.630
Huh?

16:19.630 --> 16:22.880
Or rather, combat in and of itself is futile.

16:23.630 --> 16:26.670
People hurting each other
is uncivilized and vulgar,

16:26.670 --> 16:28.580
and above all is the height of barbarism.

16:28.580 --> 16:29.420
Sure is!

16:29.420 --> 16:30.000
Eh?

16:30.000 --> 16:31.080
Crap...

16:31.080 --> 16:34.960
I just blurted that out after meeting
someone who gets me for the first time...

16:36.670 --> 16:39.080
Going back to the topic at hand...

16:39.080 --> 16:40.880
This means if we join forces,

16:40.880 --> 16:45.250
neither country will be able to
interfere in Gerra-Aruka anymore.

16:45.250 --> 16:47.750
And so, Miss Gandesblood,

16:47.750 --> 16:51.250
the reason why I sought this
meeting with you today...

16:51.830 --> 16:54.380
is that I need your help.

16:54.380 --> 16:55.040
Huh?

16:55.040 --> 16:57.880
You have an absolute power.

16:57.880 --> 17:01.580
An absolute power about the same as mine...

17:01.580 --> 17:03.790
Are you that strong, Karla?

17:05.040 --> 17:07.580
Are you suddenly calling me
by my first name?

17:07.960 --> 17:09.580
Oh... Sorry.

17:09.580 --> 17:11.460
Well, it's fine.

17:12.710 --> 17:14.380
I am strong.

17:14.380 --> 17:18.380
And I'm not showing off or exaggerating,
as the objective truth,

17:18.380 --> 17:22.960
there is also public recognition that
I'm stronger than anyone else in this world.

17:22.960 --> 17:26.250
O-oh yeah.
I'm the strongest too, you know.

17:26.500 --> 17:28.330
But I'm the strongest, though.

17:29.290 --> 17:32.330
In any case, I'll ask you again.

17:32.880 --> 17:36.210
Will you join me in bringing
peace to the world?

17:36.210 --> 17:40.830
Karla... do you think it'll be good
if wars stopped happening?

17:40.830 --> 17:42.540
Of course I do...

17:42.540 --> 17:46.380
Though this ideology isn't well understood.

17:50.250 --> 17:51.500
I get it.

17:51.500 --> 17:54.920
To tell the truth, I'm a pacifist as well.

17:56.290 --> 17:58.040
Why don't we give this our all together?

17:58.960 --> 18:00.250
Your Excellency!

18:00.250 --> 18:04.750
The 7th Unit has received a letter
from Nelia Cunningham!

18:04.750 --> 18:06.170
Nelia?

18:06.670 --> 18:09.880
Are you acquainted with Gerra-Aruka's
Eight Illustrious Generals?

18:09.880 --> 18:11.630
A-actually...

18:11.630 --> 18:13.880
Nelia is someone I correspond with,

18:13.880 --> 18:16.250
and the last tea party we had
was a good time.

18:16.250 --> 18:18.080
That's gotta be what's written...

18:19.500 --> 18:20.710
"Hello.

18:19.710 --> 18:20.710
<b>"Hello.</b>

18:20.710 --> 18:21.750
You will pay."

18:20.710 --> 18:21.750
<b>"Hello. You will pay."</b>

18:21.880 --> 18:23.460
Right, just as I thought!

18:23.460 --> 18:25.540
What in the world did you do to her?

18:25.540 --> 18:26.630
Vill...

18:27.420 --> 18:29.330
Give her a good explanation, okay?

18:29.330 --> 18:30.750
And I mean GOOD!

18:31.500 --> 18:33.250
The other day, Lady Komari...

18:33.250 --> 18:36.710
surprise attacked Nelia Cunningham's
troops and destroyed them.

18:36.710 --> 18:39.330
Tell her something better than that!

18:39.330 --> 18:41.330
What is the meaning of this?!

18:41.330 --> 18:43.630
Was your pacifist belief a lie?!

18:43.630 --> 18:46.130
It isn't a lie! I'm...

18:55.420 --> 18:59.250
I can't understand the mind of
someone who loves peace...

18:59.250 --> 19:01.080
I'm a slaughterist!

19:01.080 --> 19:03.420
S-so I've been deceived?!

19:03.420 --> 19:07.000
I know very well that Mulnite
is a savage country!

19:07.000 --> 19:09.210
I can't imagine associating with
vampires, like all of you,

19:09.210 --> 19:12.250
who cannonball into things
without thinking of consequences!

19:12.250 --> 19:14.750
Our alliance is back to square one!

19:14.750 --> 19:16.420
That's inexcusable.

19:17.130 --> 19:20.130
Suddenly suggesting an alliance

19:20.130 --> 19:23.630
and then treating us like a savage country
when talks break down?

19:23.920 --> 19:27.080
Sounds like fairly selfish behavior,
don't you think?

19:28.630 --> 19:30.250
Komari.

19:30.250 --> 19:33.540
Kill this imbecile that has insulted Mulnite.

19:33.540 --> 19:34.500
Huh?

19:35.080 --> 19:37.040
What?! No, no, no!

19:37.040 --> 19:38.920
I could never possibly...

19:38.920 --> 19:41.250
Yes, Your Excellency, let's kill her!

19:41.250 --> 19:44.670
All right, let's do this!
Prepare yourself, Karla!

19:45.500 --> 19:49.880
I'll have you know that I'm the winner of
the National Murderer's Tournament!

19:50.250 --> 19:52.920
I can murder 5,000 people in five seconds!

19:53.330 --> 19:55.210
Wh-who cares!

19:55.210 --> 19:57.830
As an additional effect after
I've killed 5,000 in five seconds,

19:57.830 --> 20:01.000
I can kill 50,000 more!

20:01.000 --> 20:02.460
In that case,

20:02.460 --> 20:06.630
by invoking the most extreme magic,
after I kill 50,000 people extra people,

20:06.630 --> 20:08.790
while I'm at it I can reduce
the Mulnite Empire to ashes

20:08.790 --> 20:10.830
and kill 50,000,000 people!

20:10.830 --> 20:12.710
Then, I wi-

20:22.580 --> 20:23.670
Whoa!

20:24.210 --> 20:25.330
Ouch...

20:27.630 --> 20:29.630
D-don't come near me!

20:29.630 --> 20:32.000
How tyrannical of you to
suddenly go for murder!

20:32.000 --> 20:34.460
Listen closely, Karla Amatsu.

20:34.830 --> 20:38.380
If you don't want to be murdered,
enter an alliance with Mulnite.

20:40.670 --> 20:42.670
I suppose I have no choice.

20:42.670 --> 20:47.210
I shouldn't go to war, but there are
things that cannot be avoided.

20:48.130 --> 20:50.420
Also, I just remembered,

20:50.420 --> 20:54.330
but even if there is war with Gerra-Aruka
it will be nothing special.

20:54.750 --> 20:57.420
I am the strongest, after all.

20:57.420 --> 20:59.290
So, which is it?

20:59.710 --> 21:01.290
Very well.

21:01.790 --> 21:05.670
Heavenly Paradise will assist with
the Mulnite Empire's battles.

21:08.380 --> 21:12.830
Well, I'll just be glad that
no one died for now.

21:14.750 --> 21:18.330
Seriously, how did this happen?

21:20.000 --> 21:21.420
Cunningham.

21:21.920 --> 21:25.040
It looks like you missed your chance
to kill Gandesblood.

21:25.040 --> 21:26.670
Is that a problem?

21:26.670 --> 21:28.500
You know it is.

21:28.500 --> 21:32.130
Honestly, this is a blunder that
makes me want to cover my eyes.

21:32.130 --> 21:36.330
You have no understanding of
the interests of the state.

21:36.330 --> 21:40.420
Your mission was to kill and capture her.

21:41.080 --> 21:43.170
My deepest apologies.

21:43.170 --> 21:46.630
Make yourself as useful as possible to me.

21:46.630 --> 21:50.250
You don't want to end up
like your father, do you?

21:53.460 --> 21:54.210
He seriously pisses me off, that old geezer!

21:54.210 --> 21:56.040
Please don't be angry, Lady Nelia!
He seriously pisses me off, that old geezer!<b></b>

21:56.040 --> 21:57.460
Please don't be angry, Lady Nelia!

21:59.580 --> 22:01.250
I'm going to change Aruka.

22:02.750 --> 22:05.960
That is my mission.

22:08.880 --> 22:10.380
Lady Nelia...

22:10.960 --> 22:14.670
Gertrude, I'm going to make
Komari a servant.

22:15.500 --> 22:18.000
I need her for my plans.

22:19.210 --> 22:23.920
With that vampire, I may be able to
turn the world upside down!

23:58.670 --> 24:00.670
"The Princess of Aruka Kingdom."

23:58.670 --> 24:01.000
<b>The Princess of Aruka Kingdom</b>
